dist/

# Self-signed certificates generated by the test suite into the package
# directory. `go test ./internal/api/` mints a forgepanel.local pair here, so a
# plain `git add -A` after a test run commits a private key. It is throwaway
# material and not a credential to anything, and it still must never be in a
# commit — least of all in the public mirror.
internal/api/certs/
.singbox-stage/
